     "content_html": "<p><span data-math=\"\\left( {2{x^2} - 4x + 5} \\right) + \\left( {3{x^2} + x - 12} \\right)\"></span></p>\n<p>Like terms are constants or have the same variable and exponent. Group the like terms.</p>\n<p><span data-math=\"\\left( {2{x^2} + 3{x^2}} \\right) + \\left( { - 4x + x} \\right) + \\left( {5 + \\left( { - 12} \\right)} \\right)\"></span></p>\n<p>Add the coefficients and keep the same variable.</p>\n<p><span data-math=\"5{x^2} - 3x - 7\"></span></p>"
